/Title (Aim for 128oz \(thats a gallon\) per day. Split it into thirds: a big glass when you wake up, another mid-morning, the rest through the afternoon. Then work the rest in throughout the day. This is not a wellness trend. Water directly affects hunger signals, energy, and metabolism. Within one week most people notice a clear difference. Start here.)
